# Small Source or Summary Files

| File | Format | Purpose | Source |
|---|---|---|---|
| Genome sequence | FASTA (`.fasta`) | Contains the complete *Arabidopsis thaliana* chloroplast genome sequence used for Galaxy sequence analysis. | NCBI RefSeq, NC_000932.1 |
| Annotated genome | GenBank (`.gb`) | Contains annotated genes, gene coordinates, CDS, tRNA, rRNA, introns, and other chloroplast genome features. | NCBI RefSeq / GeSeq, NC_000932.1 |
| Genome source information | TXT / Markdown (`.txt` / `.md`) | Records the organism, accession number, genome description, genome size, topology, and database source used for the analysis. | NCBI RefSeq, NC_000932.1 |
| Genome summary | TXT (`.txt`) | Provides a summary of genome size, GC content, sequence statistics, base composition, and LSC–IR–SSC–IR organization. | NCBI RefSeq + Galaxy |
| Gene summary | TXT (`.txt`) | Summarizes the annotated gene content, including protein-coding genes, tRNA genes, rRNA genes, pseudogenes, and important structural features. | GeSeq / NCBI RefSeq, NC_000932.1 |
